{{JPExclusive}}
'''Emilia & Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by completing any stage in [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event#Kaohsiung Metro Light Rail|Kaohsiung Metro Light Rail]] during the [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 639
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Emilia & Cat
|name2 = Emilia & Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Emilia & Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Unlike the other units found in her collab, Emilia & Cat has rather good uptime on her Freeze against [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies thanks to her multi-hit attack, making it significantly easier in theory to get a reliable perma-freeze out of her. Unfortunately, she remains ineffective due to her terrible stats and range, which limit her usage to [[Heavenly Hippoe]], [[Angelic Gory]], and [[Boraphim]]. Her Single-Target attacks cut this down even further, as the former two tend to spawn in large numbers, making her way too situational to see proper usage. By the time the player is seeing Angel enemies, they'll likely also have [[Juliet Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Juliet Cat]] or [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]], both of which are way better at stopping the advancement of these enemies, so the only usage Emilia will have by then is as User Rank.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

